{
  "name": "alpine-peak-voice-chatbot-rag-FIXED-005",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🌟 ALPINE PEAK VOICE CHATBOT WORKFLOW - FIXED RAG\n\n## Overview\nComplete RAG-powered chatbot with FIXED embedding integration\n\n## KEY FIX APPLIED\n✅ **Embeddings OpenAI node now properly connected**\n✅ **Text flows through embeddings BEFORE vector search**\n✅ **Using latest n8n v1.112.0 compatible nodes**\n\n## Key Features\n✅ **Dual Input**: Text + Voice webhooks\n✅ **RAG Knowledge Base**: Supabase vector store with embeddings\n✅ **Voice Processing**: Whisper STT + Nova TTS\n✅ **CRM Integration**: Lead capture + conversation logging\n✅ **Email Follow-up**: Automated knowledge sharing\n✅ **Emergency Handling**: Priority routing\n\n## Webhook Endpoints\n**Text**: `/webhook/alpine-peak-chatbot`\n**Voice**: `/webhook/alpine-peak-voice-chat`\n\n## Credentials Required\n- OpenAI API (GPT-4, Whisper, TTS, Embeddings)\n- Supabase API (Vector store + CRM)\n- Gmail OAuth2 (Email sending)\n\n## Architecture Flow\n1. Webhook Entry → 2. Preprocessing → 3. EMBEDDINGS → 4. RAG Search → 5. AI Response → 6. TTS (voice) → 7. CRM Logging → 8. Email Follow-up\n\n**Fixed using n8n MCP Server validation for n8n v1.112.0**",
        "height": 1156,
        "width": 712
      },
      "id": "463d0514-ee6a-4f1a-92b4-1eff4ba1d4dd",
      "name": "📋 Workflow Overview1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -464
      ]
    },
